{"id":"618098","name":"芝麻发面糖饼","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/618098/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"发面","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"碗里适量白糖。","img":"images/618098/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入适量面粉拌匀。","img":"images/618098/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒸馒头剩下两个剂子，用来做芝麻糖饼。","img":"images/618098/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"擀成厚点的圆饼。","img":"images/618098/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入一半糖粉。","img":"images/618098/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捏成大褶包子。","img":"images/618098/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀薄。","img":"images/618098/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻面，上面涂抹一点水，撒上薄薄一层白芝麻。","img":"images/618098/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用擀面杖擀一下，芝麻会粘的更牢。","img":"images/618098/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"不刷油，饼坯放锅里，小火加热。","img":"images/618098/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻面。","img":"images/618098/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盖上锅盖继续烙制饼坯鼓大泡。","img":"images/618098/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"打开锅盖再翻面。","img":"images/618098/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"盖上盖，小火再烙一会儿。","img":"images/618098/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/618098/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/618098/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/618098/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}